<title>SWITZERLAND: Ares-Serono sees successful 1997.</title>
<headline>Ares-Serono sees successful 1997.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ares-Serono SA chief executive Ernesto Bertarelli said he expected the group to post another successful year in 1997 based on good first-quarter results.</p>
<p>&quot;The year 1997 is off to a good start, with a continued good sales growth and a solid increase in operating and net income in the first quarter over last year,&quot; he said. He was especially pleased by a 25 percent rise in sales of fertility products.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect this good performance to continue, which should make 1997 another successful year for the group,&quot; he said in a statement without elaborating.</p>
</text>
